Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.9 44/45] mm/mmu_notifier: use hlist_add_head_rcu()
Date:   Fri, 19 Jul 2019 00:13:03 -0400
Message-Id: <20190719041304.18849-44-sashal@kernel.org>
